# Project conventions

- Monorepo packages: `frontend/`, `backend/`, `workers/`. Do not mix concerns across packages.
- Pakistan market product: prefer PKR and local retailer context when adding domain features.
- Keep changes minimal and production-oriented. No drive-by refactors.
- Secrets belong in `.env` only; update `.env.example` with new keys (no real values).
- Do not implement scraping, auth, ORM models, or product UI unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer `/api/v1` for new HTTP endpoints. Document run commands in package READMEs when adding services.
